in_payload_linked ?origin_availability ?payload_unit, not origin_availability_confirmed ?origin_availability). Effect: origin_node_ready, origin_availability_confirmed, cargo_available, not origin_payload_linked. So unload gives confirmed but also makes node ready and cargo available, and removes payload link. That would lose occupied and payload link. Not good.)
